<title>Netherlands: AXXICON POSTS HIGHER NINE MTHS NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>AXXICON POSTS HIGHER NINE MTHS NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VIANEN, Netherlands 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept</p>
<p>30, 1996 (in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     4.7  vs   3.1</p>
<p>    Turnover				71.0  vs  69.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     8.3  vs   5.8</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.8  vs   0.9</p>
<p>    Tax					2.8  vs   1.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial moulds maker Axxicon Group NV said it</p>
<p>maintained its forecast that 1996 full-year net profit would</p>
<p>rise to about six million guilders from 4.7 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
